# Gitignored files every new worktree needs, in gitignore syntax. Claude Code
# copies these into the worktrees it makes itself (Agent `isolation: worktree`,
# `--worktree`); `mise run worktree:new` reads this same file, so it is the one
# list for both.
#
# COPIED, never symlinked: a linked native/bin would let a worktree's
# `native:build` overwrite the main checkout's binary.

# The blade solver GDExtension — gitignored build output, but every melee
# swing push_errors without it (see docs/domain/blade-native.md).
/native/bin/

# Main's Godot import + class cache, so the first `check`/`test` re-imports
# only what differs instead of cold-importing everything. Named file by file:
# `.godot/` also holds logs and run state that must NOT travel (land.lock,
# gut-*.log/xml) and per-user editor layout.
/.godot/imported/
/.godot/shader_cache/
/.godot/uid_cache.bin
/.godot/global_script_class_cache.cfg
/.godot/extension_list.cfg
/.godot/scene_groups_cache.cfg
/.godot/editor/filesystem_cache10
/.godot/editor/editor_script_doc_cache.res
